{"availability":"available","full":"aurorascharff/next16-calendar","name":"next16-calendar","description":"A calendar and booking demo exploring Async React, Cache Components, Partial Prefetching , and View Transitions with Next.js 16.3, React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, and Prisma.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":80,"forks":9,"created":"2026-08-08T22:00:56Z","updated":"2026-09-25T06:38:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://next16-calendar.vercel.app","topics":["app-router","async-react","cache-components","calendar","nextjs","optimistic-ui","prisma","react19","rsc","server-actions","suspense","tailwindcss-v4","view-transitions"],"demo":"https://next16-calendar.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T06:38:21.130Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T06:38:21.130Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T06:38:21.130Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:32.184Z","stars":80,"forks":9},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:38:21.130Z","stars":80,"forks":9}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A calendar and booking-link workspace that demonstrates Instant Navigations in Next.js 16.3.","The architecture follows the Next.js App Architecture skill and the Component Architecture for React Server Components blog post."],"features":["Cache Components cache calendar weeks and booking-link data with 'use cache', name the data with cacheTag, and set its lifetime with cacheLife, so repeated reads come from the cache until a tag is invalidated.","Partial Prefetching prefetches one shared App Shell per route. Calendar and booking links with prefetch={true} also resolve their date or view, including the cached content behind it while uncached data streams after…","Hover-triggered prefetch upgrades only the mini-calendar date reached by pointer, keyboard focus, or touch intent, avoiding a separate prefetch for every date in view.","Server Functions run mutations — moving, creating, editing, and deleting events, and booking a slot — on the server and invalidate only the tags they change with updateTag.","React Compiler memoizes components automatically, so the code needs no manual useMemo/useCallback."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-calendar/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"37d7b3b25aba2b89c5159a99ed66158dcac9c2a59a9a7fc78c9e2d714ccf80ef","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:32.297Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:32.297Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A calendar and booking-link workspace that demonstrates Instant Navigations in Next.js 16.3.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-calendar/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"37d7b3b25aba2b89c5159a99ed66158dcac9c2a59a9a7fc78c9e2d714ccf80ef","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-calendar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:32.297Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-25T06:38:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-calendar/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:32.297Z","hash":"37d7b3b25aba2b89c5159a99ed66158dcac9c2a59a9a7fc78c9e2d714ccf80ef","originalBytes":4332,"storedBytes":4332,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["run","pnpm","prisma","cache","calendar","data","react","url","app","components","database","server","architecture","booking","date","flow","instant","next.js","prefetch","set","sqlite","view","bash","booking-link","compiler","content","env.local","file","functions","keep","license","locally","navigations","next","only","postgres","postgres.","postgresql","prisma.push","prisma.seed","provider","streams","suspense","swap","they","transitions","useoptimistic","accessible","adapter","adapter-better-sqlite3","adapter-pg","after","agent","api","appear","ariakit","assert","async","automatically","available.","avoiding","behaves","behind","blog","both","browse","browser.","cached","cachelife","cachetag","change","chrome","ci.","c